    add "#..............#" to rows
    add "#..............#" to rows
    add "#....####...##.#" to rows
    add "#....#..#......#" to rows
    add "#....#..#...##.#" to rows
    add "#....####...##.#" to rows
    add "#..............#" to rows
    add "#....######....#" to rows
    add "#..............#" to rows
    add "#..##....##....#" to rows
    add "#..##....##....#" to rows
    add "#..............#" to rows
    add "#......##......#" to rows
    add "#..............#" to rows
    add "################" to rows
    give back rows
thank you for defining


